2.63.m:
Bowing to her with devotion, O sage, the vaiśya went to Puṣkara.
Having performed difficult austerities at Puṣkara, he attained Kṛṣṇa the Lord;
by the grace of the Goddess, he became a servant of Kṛṣṇa.

